<title>USA: AmeriGas applies to list 126,000 units.</title>
<headline>AmeriGas applies to list 126,000 units.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriGas Propane Inc said Wednesday that its directors approved an application to get New York Stock Exchange listing for 126,000 common units of AmeriGas Partners LP.</p>
<p>AmeriGas Propane, the general partner of AmeriGas Partners LP, said the units will be used in the partnership's acquisition program.</p>
<p>UGI Corp owns 58 percent of AmeriGas Partners, and individual unitholders own 42 percent of the retail propane marketer.</p>
</text>
